'''Zombie Slayer''' is a [[Slayer]] that involves killing [[Zombie]]s and at the end, the {{MobSprite|Revenant Horror}} or the [[Revenant Horror#Tier V|Atoned Horror]]. The boss will always drop {{Item|Revenant Flesh}}.

